      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      * HEADER.CPY - Standard report header fields                    *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       01 WS-REPORT-HEADER.
          05 WS-COMPANY-NAME   PIC X(40) VALUE 'ACME CORPORATION'.
          05 WS-REPORT-TITLE   PIC X(40) VALUE SPACES.
          05 WS-REPORT-DATE    PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
          05 WS-PAGE-NUMBER    PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZEROS.
